@startuml getForwardingConstructListForTheFcPortAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getForwardingConstructListForTheFcPortAsync – Retrieve Forwarding-Constructs by fc-port LTP UUID and Direction
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ForwardingDomain" as fdRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - ltpUuid
  - fcPortDirection (INPUT, OUTPUT, MANAGEMENT)
end note

requestor -> fdRes: (ltpUuid, fcPortDirection)
activate fdRes

fdRes -> jd: read forwarding-domain list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> fdRes: list of all forwarding-constructs
deactivate jd

note over fdRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through all forwarding-constructs
  - For each fc-port in a forwarding-construct:
      * Check if fc-port's LTP matches ltpUuid
      * Check if fc-port's port direction matches fcPortDirection
  - Collect forwarding-constructs with matching fc-port(s)
  - Return array of matching forwarding-constructs
  - Return empty array if none found
end note

fdRes --> requestor: List of forwardingConstruct objects | []
deactivate fdRes

@enduml
